for exp in expected['records']:
 p=next(x for x in pred if x['id']==exp['id']);r=exp['sourceRelation'];edges=p['activeRelations'];a=next((x for x in edges if x['id']=='scientific:'+r['taskId']),None)
 ok=a is not None and a['type']==r['relationCategory'] and a['exactAssertion']==r['exactAssertion'] and a['applicability']==r['applicability'] and a['conventionDictionary']==r['conventionDictionary'] and p['questionIdentity'].startswith('Not established') and not p['reservedExpectedLabelsRead']
 grades.append({'id':exp['id'],'passedExactSourceRelationPreservation':ok,'expectedCategory':r['relationCategory'],'questionEquivalenceEstablished':False,'interpretation':'Generic exact-endpoint ledger lookup preserves an already reviewed relation and its scope; this is not evidence that lexical factors infer an unseen scientific relationship.'})
