finding('F03','2205.06065','without large field-space curvature','The curved_field_space assumption mention omits the without-large qualifier. It must not become evidence that large curvature is required.','Keep the explicit negated/limited curvature condition and magnitude qualifier. No hard constraint from a positive lexical token.')
finding('F04','1807.05240','entropy kinetic coefficient provides amplification','An entirely unassigned unit explicitly describes entropy-mode amplification through field-dependent kinetic coupling.','Add proposed perturbation-amplification target and kinetic-coupling method, with stationary background chi scope. Its methodological navigation can cross physical backgrounds without merging questions.')
