finding('F06','0803.0859','decreasing, initially very large sound speed','The no-inflation polarity is retained, but there is no useful sound-speed/primordial-fluctuation bridge to other mechanisms.','Retain noninflationary expansion as its own scope and add comparison/method search on sound-speed evolution and scale-invariant perturbations; source review is needed before an admitted uses_method edge.')
