out={'schemaVersion':'q025-factor-independent-challenge/1','cohortSha256':sha(G/'cohort-v1.json'),'factorRulesSha256':sha(G/'factor_rules_v1.json'),'factorDraftSha256':sha(G/'factors-v1.json'),'predictionsSha256':sha(G/'results/post-rule-predictions.json'),'sealedExpectationsSha256':public['expectationsSha256'],'postRuleGrades':grades,'findings':findings,'coverage':'Eight explicit failure/omission findings selected from reading candidate factor descriptions; not an exhaustive scientific annotation of all87 units. Warm-PBH phase distinction additionally rests on the prior native source pilot.','conclusion':'Typed navigation preserves useful distinctions but the lexical prototype cannot yet establish physical scope. Repair polarity, interrogative/comparison role, temporal phases and missing methods; use source-reviewed factors to reaggregate and overlap, never as universal cannot-link rules.','holdoutClaim':'These controls are based on previously exposed admitted receipts and known development descriptions. No blind-source or population-generalization claim; no sealed24 source paper consumed.'}
